golden: retouch-clone
producer: appname-conformance regen_retouch_goldens via the ASSEMBLED engine; two independent productions byte-compared
inputs: doc.new 128x96 white; brush.stroke hard-round-16 red[1,0,0,0] sizePx 10 seed 0 (base band); clone.stroke source=self offset [0,-14] aligned(default) seed 3 over the same samples path (§21.1 aligned-offset clone)
witnesses: the clone deposits the offset source band (state hash changes)
evidence: undo/redo byte-identity + journal-replay identity re-proven at production (state hash ContentHash(3b46f78d955e0de2890f360d61ba30224ee39399ec6a89aa37384d447de3e7c9))
package: retouch-clone.appname (265977 bytes)
package.sha256: 55c6e243608a6a6c98da2cc2ef5e5a15ca0592e7cf216964f340a59028ad37d6
