seed-rationale: dynamics RNG is command-seeded (PCG32, §15.4; omitted → 0); Part 45 retouch stochastic choices derive from blake3(mergeKey) (§45 intro; absent → blake3(id)) — replay bit-identical either way; fixed ids + fixed seeds pin two-production byte-identity
rule: goldens change only via O-QA review (plan section 0.6 rule 6); regenerate with `cargo run -p appname-conformance --bin regen_retouch_goldens`
